# Environment template — local lab overrides (optional)

Boot defaults come from committed `conf/aiorchestrator.properties` (port **:8011**).
Copy to `.env` only if you inject env into the process; env overrides properties.
No engines or vendor keys are preset — configure via Control API after boot.

# DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/aiorchestrator?sslmode=disable
# REQUIRE_DATABASE=1
# HTTP_ADDR=:8011
# LOG_LEVEL=info
# LOG_FORMAT=json

# Lab-only Sarvam fallback (prefer PUT /v1/tenant/credentials/sarvam)
# SARVAM_API_KEY=

# AIORCH_PROPERTIES=conf/aiorchestrator.properties
